<view class="auth-page">
  <view class="auth-hero">
    <image class="auth-hero__img" src="/assets/hero-table.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image>
    <view class="auth-hero__shade"></view>
    <view class="auth-brand" style="top: {{navTop}}px;">two<text>.</text></view>
    <view class="auth-hero__note">A TABLE FOR TWO</view>
  </view>

  <view class="auth-panel">
    <view class="auth-card">
      <view class="auth-kicker">WELCOME TO TWO.</view>
      <view class="auth-title">今晚，<text>从一张菜单开始。</text></view>
      <view class="auth-sub">登录后，先给这张只属于两个人的餐桌加一道菜，再把邀请发给 TA。</view>

      <view class="auth-features">
        <view class="auth-feature">
          <view class="feature-dot"></view>
          <view class="feature-copy"><text>只属于两个人</text><text>没有商家，没有价格，只有今晚。</text></view>
        </view>
        <view class="auth-feature">
          <view class="feature-dot"></view>
          <view class="feature-copy"><text>15 道家常菜</text><text>再加一道你们自己的拿手菜。</text></view>
        </view>
        <view class="auth-feature">
          <view class="feature-dot"></view>
          <view class="feature-copy"><text>一纸留言</text><text>订单和想说的话，一起送到。</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="auth-login {{loading ? 'is-loading' : ''}}" bindtap="login" aria-role="button" aria-label="微信一键登录">
        <view class="auth-login__dot"></view>
        {{loading ? '正在登录…' : '微信一键登录'}}
      </view>
      <view class="auth-legal">登录即创建一张私密餐桌 · 原型数据只保存在当前设备</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
